# M6 headless test: 12 local devices on one screen (bopl-port --headless
#   --drive scripts/dev/m6-12.drive --screenshot scratch/m6/d12.png).
# Both keyboard halves and ten controllers join character select, pick
# colours / abilities, ready up and start; bots then play their players
# (the devices still drive the wheel and the winner screen) for three
# rounds; back to character select. Syntax: crates/game/src/driver.rs.
0 wait menu
30 press pad0 accept          # Play
0 wait charsel
20 press kl start             # left keyboard half (Tab) joins box 0
6 press kr start              # right keyboard half (Keypad Enter) joins box 1
6 press pad0 accept
6 press pad1 start
6 press pad2 accept
6 press pad3 accept
6 press pad4 accept
6 press pad5 accept
6 press pad6 accept
6 press pad7 accept
6 press pad8 accept
6 press pad9 accept
30 shot 01-joined
# a few choices: colours, abilities, the grid
8 press pad3 down
8 press pad3 right
8 press pad4 down
8 press pad4 accept
10 press pad4 right
8 press pad4 down
10 shot 02-grid
8 press pad4 accept
8 press kl down
8 press kl down
8 press kl down
8 press kl down
8 press kl right
20 shot 03-select
# ready: controllers with Start, keyboard halves on the ready row
8 press kl down
8 press kl accept
8 press kr up
8 press kr up
8 press kr accept
4 press pad0 start
4 press pad1 start
4 press pad2 start
4 press pad3 start
4 press pad4 start
4 press pad5 start
4 press pad6 start
4 press pad7 start
4 press pad8 start
4 press pad9 start
30 shot 04-ready
8 press pad0 start            # start!
0 wait match
0 bot kl
0 bot kr
0 bot pad0
0 bot pad1
0 bot pad2
0 bot pad3
0 bot pad4
0 bot pad5
0 bot pad6
0 bot pad7
0 bot pad8
0 bot pad9
40 shot 05-flyin
0 wait round
40 shot 06-round
0 wait wheel any
8 press loser up 4
30 shot 07-wheel-open
8 press loser left 4
20 press loser down 4
20 press loser left 4
20 shot 08-wheel-changed
8 press loser jump 4
0 wait winner
10 shot 09-winner-1
60 shot 10-winner-1-prompts
8 press pad5 jump             # next level
0 wait level
60 shot 11-level-2
0 wait round
200 shot 12-level-2-round
0 wait winner
60 shot 13-winner-2
8 press kr jump
0 wait level
0 wait winner
60 shot 14-winner-3
8 press pad2 select           # back to character select
0 wait charsel
40 shot 15-charsel-back
5 quit
